'''Shiki no Miagata Nimasu Shrine''' (志貴御縣坐神社) is a shrine located at Kanaya 896 in {{ill|Sakurai City|ja|桜井市}}, {{ill|Nara Prefecture|ja|奈良県}}. It is a {{ill|Shikinai-sha|ja|式内社}} ({{ill|Shikinai-taisha|ja|式内大社}}) whose former status was that of a {{ill|Sonsha|ja|村社}}.

