'''Shiki no Miagata Nimasu Shrine''' (志貴御縣坐神社) is a shrine located at Kanaya 896 in {{ill|Sakurai City|ja|桜井市|12=draft}}, {{ill|Nara Prefecture|ja|奈良県|12=draft}}. It is a {{ill|Shikinai-sha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|12=draft}} ({{ill|Shikinai-taisha|ja|式内大社|12=draft}}) whose former status was that of a {{ill|Sonsha|ja|村社|12=draft}}.

==Enshrined Deities==

