'''Shiki no Miagata Nimasu Shrine''' (志貴御縣坐神社) is a shrine located at Kanaya 896 in {{ill|Sakurai City|ja|桜井市|qq=draft|qq=draft}}, {{ill|Nara Prefecture|ja|奈良県|qq=draft|qq=draft}}. It is a {{ill|Shikinai-sha|ja|式内社|1=Shikinaisha|qq=draft|qq=draft}} ({{ill|Shikinai-taisha|ja|式内大社|qq=draft|qq=draft}}) whose former status was that of a {{ill|Sonsha|ja|村社|qq=draft|qq=draft}}.

